    <string name="integration_screenscraper_desc">Hash-matched retro box art, fanart and descriptions</string>
    <string name="integration_screenscraper_help">Needs a devid/devpassword pair registered as a \"software\" at screenscraper.fr. Your personal account below is optional and raises your daily quota.</string>
    <string name="integration_igdb_desc">General game database - covers, screenshots, summaries</string>
    <string name="integration_igdb_help">Create a free app at dev.twitch.tv/console/apps to get a Client ID and Client Secret - IGDB authenticates through Twitch.</string>
    <string name="integration_steamgriddb_desc">Community grids and hero art - covers and backgrounds only</string>
    <string name="integration_steamgriddb_help">Get a free API key from steamgriddb.com/profile/preferences/api.</string>
    <string name="integration_retroachievements_desc">Account link for achievements - not used for cover art yet</string>
    <string name="integration_retroachievements_help">Find your API key at retroachievements.org/settings. Elyndra stores it for future achievement tracking; the public API has no reliable per-game search endpoint, so this source isn\'t used for automatic covers or backgrounds.</string>
    <string name="integration_launchbox_desc">Not available as a live integration</string>
    <string name="integration_launchbox_help">LaunchBox Games Database doesn\'t publish a public search API - only a bulk offline Metadata.zip download intended for the LaunchBox desktop app itself. There\'s no username or API key that would let Elyndra query it per-game, so it can\'t be wired in as a scraping source here.</string>

